\fs14 \

\pard\tx3600\tx3980\tx4340\i0\fs28\li1500\fc0\cf0 Allows the delegate to specify custom sizing behavior for the subviews of the NSSplitView. If the delegate implements this method, 
\b splitView:resizeSubviewsWithOldSize:
\b0  is invoked after the NSSplitView is resized. The size of the NSSplitView before the user resized it is indicated by 
\i oldSize
\i0 ; the subviews should be resized such that the sum of the heights of the subviews plus the sum of the thickness of the dividers equals the height of the NSSplitView's new frame. You can get the height of a divider through the 
\b dividerThickness
\b0  method.\

